  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1401.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1401.02 Applicability.\n\n(a) The rules in this chapter shall apply to all facilities, except as provided by (b) below.\n\n(b) The rules in this chapter shall not apply to a:\n\n(1) Permit-exempt facility;\n\n(2) Permit-by-notification facility;\n\n(3) Emergency permit facility;\n\n(4) Limited private non-landfill facility; or\n\n(5) Limited public non-landfill facility.\n\nSource. #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1400); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 3101.02); ss by #10599, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14068, eff 9-3-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw1400.html"
